Aerie-Purpose: Attach the cosmetic filtering tab helper to every tab, so the Filter Engine's hide rules reach each page.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/tabs/tab_features.cc (TabFeatures::Init and the new-contents path), chrome/browser/ui/tabs/BUILD.gn (impl deps)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Two CreateForWebContents() calls next to ChromeTranslateClient's: one when a tab's
features start, one when its contents are replaced (discard and restore). The
helper is idempotent per WebContents. It lives in chrome/browser/aerie_adblock
(the overlay), see docs/adblock.md.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/tabs/BUILD.gn
